# The menu module (retreat_module_menu, from Retreat-Modules): a pause menu declared with the UI
# toolkit, toggled with Escape, whose buttons run command lines.
# Run: cargo run -p retreat_sandbox -- --headless --commands scripts/verify/module_menu.cmds
# Expected pictures:
#   menu_hidden.png:   the usual scene and toolbar, no menu.
#   menu_shown.png:    a centered column: the title "Paused" and three buttons, Resume, Reset boxes,
#                      Quit, one under the other; the toolbar and the scene behind it.
#   menu_reflowed.png: the same menu without the "Reset boxes" button: two buttons, the panel
#                      smaller and still centered (no gap where the button was).
#   menu_closed.png:   no menu again, after the Resume button closed it, and two boxes at rest.

snapshot menu_hidden
# Escape is bound to the module action menu_toggle, which runs menu.toggle.
input.tap Escape
wait 2
snapshot menu_shown
ui.hide_entry pause_menu reset
wait 2
snapshot menu_reflowed
ui.show_entry pause_menu reset
# Boxes first (toolbar button), then the Resume button closes the menu.
ui.press toolbar drop_box
ui.press toolbar drop_box
wait 2
ui.press pause_menu resume
wait 192
snapshot menu_closed
state.hash
assert.state_hash 0x83d629cc1d00e5a5
quit
